<title>TANZANIA: Tanzania shilling unchanged on dlr, falls on pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzania shilling unchanged on dlr, falls on pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling was unchanged on the dollar and gained on the pound, the central Bank of Tanzania said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Against the dollar, the shilling exchanged at a commercial mean rate of 600.1380, while against the pound, it exchanged at a mean rate of 976.8761 compared to Monday's 979.3682.</p>
</text>
